// Creatures and machines met in the roguelike exploration (E9, see rogue.rs). hp: points of
// health; attack: damage per blow to a member of the party (before armour); defense: share of the
// party's damage it shrugs off; sight: how far it notices you; min_depth: first floor it appears
// on (0 = the entrance floor); loot: (resource, min kg, max kg) it drops when it dies.
